{
  "source": "Prompts/how-ai-answers-v12.mp4",
  "duration": 214.9333125,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.52,
      "text": "When you ask an AI a question, it first works out what your words mean together."
    },
    {
      "start": 5.06,
      "end": 8.6,
      "text": "But once it understands your prompt, how does it actually begin its reply?"
    },
    {
      "start": 9.28,
      "end": 10.52,
      "text": "Let's look at a simple example."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.26,
      "end": 12.64,
      "text": "What should I name my new dog?"
    },
    {
      "start": 13.34,
      "end": 15.34,
      "text": "This board shows how the process starts."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.12,
      "end": 20.28,
      "text": "First, the AI breaks your question down into smaller pieces, called tokens."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.96,
      "end": 25.54,
      "text": "Then it assigns positions, which marks exactly where each piece belongs in the sentence."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.54,
      "end": 31.14,
      "text": "Next, it turns these tokens into numbers, starting vectors that carry their initial meaning."
    },
    {
      "start": 31.84,
      "end": 38.72,
      "text": "As this information passes through the model's layers, attention mechanisms update those numbers, using context from the entire message."
    },
    {
      "start": 39.44,
      "end": 42.32,
      "text": "The entire reading process builds toward the end of the prompt."
    },
    {
      "start": 42.86,
      "end": 47.48,
      "text": "The AI relies on this final token's updated numbers to predict what word comes next."
    },
    {
      "start": 48.84,
      "end": 53.6,
      "text": "This board isolates that exact transition point, the moment reading becomes writing."
    },
    {
      "start": 53.6,
      "end": 58.28,
      "text": "We are looking at how the AI prepares to generate the very first word of its response."
    },
    {
      "start": 59.02,
      "end": 61.22,
      "text": "The final token acts as a funnel."
    },
    {
      "start": 61.82,
      "end": 66.02,
      "text": "The question mark gathers information from every single token before it."
    },
    {
      "start": 66.52,
      "end": 74.42,
      "text": "The AI takes this specific final token's updated vector and uses it to calculate a probability score for every possible word."
    },
    {
      "start": 75.08,
      "end": 82.46,
      "text": "That single token is the launching pad, providing the exact mathematical information needed to predict a fitting first token."
    },
    {
      "start": 83.48,
      "end": 85.62,
      "text": "The AI is now ready to reply."
    },
    {
      "start": 86.16,
      "end": 93.18,
      "text": "It uses those numbers from the final token to calculate a probability score for every potential next token in its entire vocabulary."
    },
    {
      "start": 93.92,
      "end": 96.16,
      "text": "This triggers a repeating generation loop."
    },
    {
      "start": 96.86,
      "end": 103.38,
      "text": "The AI selects a token, adds it to the growing reply, and then uses that newly expanded context to predict again."
    },
    {
      "start": 103.8,
      "end": 105.22,
      "text": "What should I name my new dog?"
    },
    {
      "start": 105.22,
      "end": 107.04,
      "text": "Let's look at prediction 1."
    },
    {
      "start": 107.46,
      "end": 113.42,
      "text": "Because the reply hasn't started yet, the AI is solely using the question mark as its final context token."
    },
    {
      "start": 114.0,
      "end": 120.96,
      "text": "The top predictions for this first slot are U at 18%, A at 14%, and Great at 9%."
    },
    {
      "start": 120.96,
      "end": 124.44,
      "text": "In this instance, the AI selects U to start the sentence."
    },
    {
      "start": 124.98,
      "end": 126.9,
      "text": "Three subsequent prediction cycles occur."
    },
    {
      "start": 127.5,
      "end": 133.58,
      "text": "The AI runs the loop repeatedly, smoothly adding the tokens could, name, and him to the sequence."
    },
    {
      "start": 134.32,
      "end": 139.5,
      "text": "Arriving at prediction 5, our context has now grown to read, you could name him."
    },
    {
      "start": 140.08,
      "end": 144.9,
      "text": "This means the word him acts as the new final token to launch the next prediction."
    },
    {
      "start": 145.78,
      "end": 149.56,
      "text": "Based on this longer context, the top predictions shift significantly."
    },
    {
      "start": 150.18,
      "end": 156.32,
      "text": "We see Spot at 22%, Max at 17%, and Buddy at 14%."
    },
    {
      "start": 156.32,
      "end": 159.02,
      "text": "The AI selects Spot to complete the thought."
    },
    {
      "start": 159.02,
      "end": 161.9,
      "text": "The completed sequence forms a full sentence."
    },
    {
      "start": 162.5,
      "end": 163.46,
      "text": "You could name him Spot."
    },
    {
      "start": 164.22,
      "end": 166.1,
      "text": "You might notice a slight disconnect here."
    },
    {
      "start": 166.68,
      "end": 171.54,
      "text": "We specifically asked for a dog name, yet the AI started its answer with the word U."
    },
    {
      "start": 172.18,
      "end": 177.1,
      "text": "It did this because U is a highly probable, natural way to begin conversational text,"
    },
    {
      "start": 177.54,
      "end": 180.36,
      "text": "even before the specific subject of the dog is introduced."
    },
    {
      "start": 181.18,
      "end": 183.66,
      "text": "Each added token changes what can fit next."
    },
    {
      "start": 183.66,
      "end": 187.54,
      "text": "It is only after the sequence you could name him is established"
    },
    {
      "start": 187.54,
      "end": 191.56,
      "text": "that a specific dog name becomes the statistically obvious next choice."
    },
    {
      "start": 192.36,
      "end": 193.82,
      "text": "The loop doesn't go on forever."
    },
    {
      "start": 194.5,
      "end": 200.44,
      "text": "AI keeps predicting tokens until it produces a special token that signals the answer is finished."
    },
    {
      "start": 201.26,
      "end": 204.28,
      "text": "This repeating cycle has a formal name, inference."
    },
    {
      "start": 205.16,
      "end": 207.48,
      "text": "Every answer is built one token at a time."
    },
    {
      "start": 207.84,
      "end": 209.46,
      "text": "The whole run is called inference."
    }
  ],
